38,"author":"Yeo Jiun Tzen","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Education_Department_-_Sarawak_Pavilion_02.jpg"}},{"id":"kuching_taha_ariffin_stadium","areaId":"kuching","name":"Taha Ariffin Stadium","category":"other","tags":["family"],"location":{"lat":1.59054,"lng":110.35813},"visitMinutes":90,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"kuching_taha_ariffin_stadium","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":11,"commonsNearby":15,"wikiPageviews":946,"wikidataSitelinks":6,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["tahaariffinstadium","kuching"],"summary":"Taha Ariffin Stadium formerly State Stadium is a multi-purpose stadium in Kuching, Sarawak, Malaysia. It is currently used mostly for football matches. The stadium holds 30,000 people. The stadium hosted the Sukma Games in 1990, which Sarawak won. State Stadium is located in an area of 5 hectares in Petra Jaya.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Taha Ariffin Stadium","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Tampak_Dalam_Stadium_Negeri_Sarawak_2024_%282%29.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/Tampak_Dalam_Stadium_Negeri_Sarawak_2024_%282%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Medelam","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tampak_Dalam_Stadium_Negeri_Sarawak_2024_(2).jpg"}},{"id":"kuching_sarawak_stadium","areaId":"kuching","name":"Sarawak Stadium","category":"other","tags":["family"],"location":{"lat":1.58854,"lng":110.36019},"visitMinutes":90,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"kuching_sarawak_stadium","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":2,"commonsNearby":1,"wikiPageviews":1176,"wikidataSitelinks":14,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["sarawakstadium","kuching"],"summary":"Sarawak Stadium is a multi-purpose stadium in Kuching, Malaysia. It is currently used mostly for football matches, athletics, live concert events, conferences, and formal events. The stadium has a capacity of 50,000 spectators.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Sarawak Stadium","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Stadium_Sarawak.JPG","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/07/Stadium_Sarawak.JPG","w":1200,"h":468,"author":"Rizaliskandar at English Wikipedia","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Stadium_Sarawak.JPG"}},{"id":"kuching_indian_mosque","areaId":"kuching","name":"Indian Mosque","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":1.56111,"lng":110.34386},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kuching_indian_mosque","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":7,"wikiPageviews":40,"wikidataSitelinks":5,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["indianmosque","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Indian Mosque or Floating Mosque is a floating mosque located at the bank of Sarawak River, Kuching, Sarawak, Malaysia. The building is officiated by the former Yang di-Pertua Negeri of Sarawak, Abdul Taib Mahmud at 1 March 2019.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Indian Mosque, Kuching","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Waterfront_Kuching_view.jpg/1280px-Waterfront_Kuching_view.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Waterfront_Kuching_view.jpg/500px-Waterfront_Kuching_view.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Jjurieee","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Waterfront_Kuching_view.jpg"}},{"id":"kuching_petra_jaya_state_mosque","areaId":"kuching","name":"Petra Jaya State Mosque","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":1.58147,"lng":110.34314},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kuching_petra_jaya_state_mosque","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":0,"wikiPageviews":48,"wikidataSitelinks":10,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["petrajayastatemosque","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Petra Jaya State Mosque, officially known as Masjid Jamek Negeri Sarawak is the state mosque of Sarawak, located in Petra Jaya, Kuching, Sarawak, Malaysia. It is also known as Jamek Mosque.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Petra Jaya State Mosque"},{"id":"kuching_sarawak_state_library","areaId":"kuching","name":"Sarawak State Library","category":"other","tags":["history","art"],"location":{"lat":1.58347,"lng":110.34986},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kuching_sarawak_state_library","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.pustaka-sarawak.com/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":4,"wikiPageviews":86,"wikidataSitelinks":4,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["sarawakstatelibrary","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"18:00"},null],"note":"Closed Sun; Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"The Sarawak State Library is the state library of Sarawak, located in Kuching, Sarawak, Malaysia. It was established in 1999 with the passing of the Sarawak State Library Ordinance 1999 by the Sarawak State Legislative Assembly.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Sarawak State Library","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Pustaka_Negeri_Sarawak_%28State_Library%2C_Sarawak%2C_Malaysia%29.JPG/1280px-Pustaka_Negeri_Sarawak_%28State_Library%2C_Sarawak%2C_Malaysia%29.JPG","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d8/Pustaka_Negeri_Sarawak_%28State_Library%2C_Sarawak%2C_Malaysia%29.JPG/500px-Pustaka_Negeri_Sarawak_%28State_Library%2C_Sarawak%2C_Malaysia%29.JPG","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Librarydoctor","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pustaka_Negeri_Sarawak_(State_Library,_Sarawak,_Malaysia).JPG"}},{"id":"kuching_blessed_sacrament_church_bdc","areaId":"kuching","name":"Blessed Sacrament Church, BDC","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":1.50403,"lng":110.35298},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kuching_blessed_sacrament_church_bdc","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":27,"wikidataSitelinks":2,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["blessedsacramentchurchbdc","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Tampak_Luar_Blessed_Sacrament_Church_2024_%283%29.jpg/1280px-Tampak_Luar_Blessed_Sacrament_Church_2024_%283%29.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/29/Tampak_Luar_Blessed_Sacrament_Church_2024_%283%29.jpg/500px-Tampak_Luar_Blessed_Sacrament_Church_2024_%283%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Medelam","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tampak_Luar_Blessed_Sacrament_Church_2024_(3).jpg"}},{"id":"kuching_holy_trinity_church_kenyalang_park","areaId":"kuching","name":"Holy Trinity Church, Kenyalang Park","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":1.53735,"lng":110.36621},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kuching_holy_trinity_church_kenyalang_park","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":12,"wikidataSitelinks":2,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["holytrinitychurchkenyalangpark","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Panti_Imam_Gereja_Holy_Trinity_di_Taman_Kenyalang_%282024%29.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/Panti_Imam_Gereja_Holy_Trinity_di_Taman_Kenyalang_%282024%29.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Medelam","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Panti_Imam_Gereja_Holy_Trinity_di_Taman_Kenyalang_(2024).jpg"}},{"id":"kuching_wv_kuching_city_mosque","areaId":"kuching","name":"Kuching City Mosque","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":1.55874,"lng":110.34075},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_kuching_city_mosque","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":5,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["kuchingcitymosque","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Formerly the Sarawak State Mosque, Kuching's main mosque. Later it was re-designated as the Kuching Divisional Mosque. It was built in 1968 on a site that had been used for a wooden mosque as early as 1852. It has a striking design, featuring a combination of mid-western and Italian architecture.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Sarawak_New_Parliament_Building_-_Kuching.jpg/1280px-Sarawak_New_Parliament_Building_-_Kuching.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0f/Sarawak_New_Parliament_Building_-_Kuching.jpg/500px-Sarawak_New_Parliament_Building_-_Kuching.jpg","w":1200,"h":698,"author":"Damian Pankowiec","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sarawak_New_Parliament_Building_-_Kuching.jpg"}},{"id":"kuching_wv_lepau","areaId":"kuching","name":"Lepau","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.5536,"lng":110.35186},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_lepau","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lepaukuching","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"Interesting and good restaurant specialising in local flavours of the Sarawak traditional cuisine. Many dishes are typical of local tribes in Sarawak, definitely a culinary experience as you'll find them nowhere else. Organic food and relaxed service. The restaurant has no air conditioning but plenty of fans. Not so many tables, hence reservation is a good idea especially for dinner. A 15% tax and","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_bla_bla_bla","areaId":"kuching","name":"Bla Bla Bla","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.5554,"lng":110.34795},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_bla_bla_bla","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["blablabla","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Wayang Street (A few shops down from The Junk). A Chinese restaurant which was opened by the same restaurateurs as The Junk. It quickly became an institution for fine Chinese cuisine in Kuching shortly after it opened in 2005. The interior is designed with a Balinese theme and some of the dishes they are famous for are the ostrich-rolls, soft-shell crabs, and drunken duck. Bookings are advisable.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_open_air_market","areaId":"kuching","name":"Open Air Market","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":1.55908,"lng":110.3425},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_open_air_market","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["openairmarket","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Despite the name, the place is actually covered. It has a wide variety of stalls serving Malay and Chinese cuisine. Their most popular stall is the one serving beef noodles and sio bi (pork dumplings). Also popular is the fresh porridge and seafood stalls. But beware, this area is not the cleanest of places so order your food from only the most popular stalls.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_the_junk","areaId":"kuching","name":"The Junk","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.55589,"lng":110.34794},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_the_junk","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["thejunk","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Wayang Street (opposite Fata Hotel). Walking distance from the waterfront. Western/Italian menu and popular with locals and expats. Colonial Chinese decoration with lots of antiques. The portions are large and the lamb shanks and fisherman's basket seem to be the most popular. Bookings are advisable if you have a large group.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_top_spot_food_court","areaId":"kuching","name":"Top Spot Food Court","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":1.55612,"lng":110.35245},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_top_spot_food_court","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["topspotfoodcourt","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Has a wide range of food stalls ranging from the budget to the pricey. Most locals and tourists come here for the fresh seafood stalls which are on the pricey side. Most of the stalls serve good food, but beware; always ask to see a menu with prices - some stalls have been known to 'accidentally' over-charge tourists.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_ky_cafe","areaId":"kuching","name":"KY Cafe","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.54683,"lng":110.36472},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_ky_cafe","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["kycafe","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Run by a band of three brothers, they serve what is arguably the best 'Kolo mee' in town. Characterised by being served in an orange plastic bowl, this 'kolo mee' tastes a little bit on the sweet side and has the distinction of tasting much better towards the end. They also have excellent wonton soup.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_kubah_ria_complex","areaId":"kuching","name":"Kubah Ria Complex","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.555,"lng":110.32291},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_kubah_ria_complex","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://www.sedctourism.com/kubahria.asp","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["kubahriacomplex","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A shopping and food center by the Sarawak River very near to the historical Satok Bridge. Built by SEDC to replace the former food and beverages centre. This shopping center houses 45 shoplots and 45 food and beverage outlets. This is now the most popular eating and shopping spot in Kuching.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_authentic_hock_king_chicken_rice","areaId":"kuching","name":"Authentic Hock King Chicken Rice","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.55321,"lng":110.35438},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_authentic_hock_king_chicken_rice","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["authentichockkingchickenrice","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Basic, but quite generous meals throughout the day. Mr Hock is one of the better hosts in Kuching, fluent in multiple languages and will do almost anything to make your stay as comfortable as possible. Many local celebrities stop by for lunch regularly as Hock King is well connected.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_lau_ya_keng_food_court","areaId":"kuching","name":"Lau Ya Keng Food Court","category":"food","tags":["food","markets"],"location":{"lat":1.55847,"lng":110.34566},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_lau_ya_keng_food_court","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lauyakengfoodcourt","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A simple food court that has been around for decades and is very popular with locals for breakfast, lunch and dinner. You can buy very decent Kolo mee and Sarawak laksa here. But a lot of people come here for the fish-ball soup and famous pork satay that opens in the early afternoon.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_rojak_kuchei_batu_lintang","areaId":"kuching","name":"Rojak Kuchei Batu Lintang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.53516,"lng":110.34165},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_rojak_kuchei_batu_lintang","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["rojakkucheibatulintang","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"This place served the best rojak India and chicken rojak in the town. Don't be surprised to see a lot of visitors during morning time because this place is constantly crowded with people from the nearby offices during breakfast time.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_magenta","areaId":"kuching","name":"Magenta","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.5602,"lng":110.34558},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_magenta","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["magentakuching","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"has been relocated to the old court house at Waterfront. Beautiful colonial building with a romantic oriental ambience. Good menu with large portions. Speciality is lamb shank with mashed potato which sounds bland but is very tasty.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"},{"id":"kuching_wv_see_good_food_centre","areaId":"kuching","name":"See Good Food Centre","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":1.55321,"lng":110.35126},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"kuching_wv_see_good_food_centre","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["seegoodfoodcentre","kuching"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"Casual laid-back restaurant that serves excellent and very fresh seafood, very popular with the locals. It is best to get there early in the evenings to secure a table and minimise the waiting time, as they don't take reservations.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Kuching"}],"sources":["Wikidata (CC0)","Wikimedia Commons (counts; photos credited per file)","Wikipedia (pageviews; summaries CC BY-SA 4.0)","Wikivoyage (listings: hours, prices, descriptions; CC BY-SA 4.0)","OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL): opening hours, fees, websites"]}